        <h2 class="scan-block-h">Send one email. <span class="ox">Get real data.</span></h2>
        <div class="scan-block-body">
          <p>The scan runs the same way for every engagement. Hundreds of query variants per category, run against ChatGPT, Claude, and Google AI. Cross-referenced with Google Search Console and a rendered-markup audit of the site.</p>
          <p>You get a documented brief. Every finding tied to the source that surfaced it. Every recommendation carrying the correlation that earned it. <em>One engagement. One price.</em></p>
